[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5644840170","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123439#issuecomment-5644840170","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123439","id":5644840170,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUHVs6g","user":{"login":"chillenious","id":137683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzY4Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious","html_url":"https://github.com/chillenious","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chillenious/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-12T08:49:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T08:49:43Z","body":"Confirmed on a **runtime (non-editor) project** — the trigger is not editor-specific.\r\n\r\n- **Binary:** official `Godot_v4.8-dev5_macos.universal.zip` (`4.8.dev5.official.9552dfb68`), macOS arm64, Apple M5 Max, Forward+.\r\n- **Workload:** minimal pure-GDScript project (no GDExtension) that creates and drops 64 `ImageTexture`s per frame in `_process`. SIGBUS within ~2 seconds. Crash stack matches the original report exactly: `OffsetAllocator::Allocator::free` ← `MetalHeapAllocator::_free_allocation` ← `RenderingDeviceDriverMetal::texture_free` ← `RenderingDevice::_free_pending_resources` ← `RenderingDevice::_begin_frame` ← `RenderingServerDefault::_draw`.\r\n- **Datum supporting the miscompile analysis in #123439:** a from-source build of the same `4.8-dev5` tarball with Apple clang 21 does **not** reproduce — the identical workload runs 180+ frames clean on the locally built binary, while the official binary crashes in seconds. Consistent with the bug being toolchain-dependent rather than present in all builds of this source.\r\n\r\nMRP attached (`gh123394-mrp.zip`, 1.5 KB). The project prints `GH123394_REPRO_SURVIVED frames=180` and exits 0 if the process survives, so it doubles as a pass/fail check for the fix.\r\n\r\n[gh123394-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32140217/gh123394-mrp.zip)\r\n\r\n(AI assisted)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5644840170/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5648703466","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123439#issuecomment-5648703466","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123439","id":5648703466,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABULBf6g","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"http